sec.p:
Based on the above data, the effective mechanical properties of the cotton fiber-reinforced epoxy composites were determined using the Material Designer module in ANSYS Workbench. Since ANSYS Material Designer requires the fiber volume fraction (


      V
      f


) as input for representative volume element generation, the target fiber volume fractions of 20 vol.%, 40 vol.%, and 50 vol.% were achieved by prescribing corresponding fiber weight fractions (


      W
      f


) of 25.0%, 47.1%, and 57.2%, respectively. These weight fractions were converted using the densities of the cotton fibers (1550 kg/m



      3


) and epoxy resin (1160 kg/m



      3


) according to Eq. (1).

